                                "sense_id": "9cec115c-79d3-3b48-9997-61ea944f2091",
                                "text": "The original meaning of the root is 'put'; but, from the proethnic period, a secondary development in the line ('set,' 'establish,' and so) 'make,' 'do,' is clear."
                            },
