                                "example_id": "6f1a8f00-7246-48c1-85f0-dbd355f1875c",
                                "sense_id": "9cec115c-79d3-3b48-9997-61ea944f2091",
                                "text": "Since νς + consonant lost its y in proethnic Greek (77.2), the same would be true of final νς in close combination with a following word beginning with a consonant."
